)}

```
### 3. Maintain Current Stage "Pending Since"
Keep your existing logic for the isCurrent state, which displays the live/backend-calculated pending time for the step currently being worked on:
```javascript
{isCurrent && viewingBatchState !== "REJECTED" && (
  <Typography
    variant="caption"
    display="block"
    color={statusFlag === 'ESCALATED' ? "warning.main" : "text.secondary"}
